You are building a premium dark theme website for AdsLogic - an AI-Powered Digital Marketing Agency.

Tech Stack (strictly follow):
- Next.js 15 (App Router)
- Tailwind CSS
- Framer Motion only (no GSAP, no Three.js, no Lenis)
- Keep code simple and easy to edit later

Design Rules:
- Dark theme (background #111111 and #1A1A1A)
- Primary accent color: Orange #FF6B00 and Light Orange #FF8A1F
- Use glassmorphism effects where suitable
- Soft orange glowing accents
- Premium, modern, luxury look
- Fully responsive

Animation Rules:
- Always use Framer Motion for animations
- Prefer spring animations for hover and entrance effects
- Smooth and subtle micro-interactions
- No heavy or complicated animations

General:
- Write clean and readable code
- Make components easy to edit later
- Follow the client requirements from the PDF